    {
      "name": "@dsh-plugins-by-amin/dsh-sdlc-bridge",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH SDLC Bridge"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "SDLC V2 Bridge: P3/P5 source-census execution trackers plus P6 real UAT, P7 observed per-unit deployment and P8 service continuity. Independently reconcile approved P1-P4/P5/P6/P7 source IDs, DSH event vs ChatGPT reviewer cursors, CR/build/release/DEP evidence and owner gates. Offline structural checks only; live DSH Desktop/GitHub/production execution unverified."
